   "text": "Your server time just shifted five thirty?"
  },
  {
   "id": "bug",
   "text": "Most devs mix naive and aware datetimes."
  },
  {
   "id": "why",
   "text": "Subtract them and Python raises a TypeError, because naive time has no zone."
  },
  {
   "id": "fix",
   "text": "Store UTC with datetime dot now of timezone dot utc. Convert to I S T only for display. Now every hour matches."
  },
  {
   "id": "bait",
   "text": "Store U T C, or local I S T? Comment your answer."
  },
